function guideFaq(channel) { return [[`Can ${channel} generate financial advisor leads?`, `Yes, when the campaign has a defined audience and service, accurate and approved messaging, a trustworthy conversion path, careful qualification, consistent follow-up, and measurement beyond the initial lead.`], ['What counts as a qualified financial advisor lead?', 'The definition should reflect the firm’s services and policies. Common factors include jurisdiction, planning need, timing, relationship fit, meeting intent, and other criteria the firm is permitted and prepared to use.'], ['Should marketing promise returns or outcomes?', 'No. Avoid guarantees, promissory or exaggerated claims, unsupported comparisons, and unbalanced performance presentations. Use the firm’s compliance process and applicable rules for every claim and disclosure.'], ['What should be measured after a lead arrives?', 'Track contact, qualification, booked and attended appointments, suitable opportunities, client outcomes where appropriate, acquisition cost, time to outcome, and lost reasons.']]; }
