<section class="fa-ppc-block"><p class="eyebrow">Process and expectations</p><h2>A Practical 90-Day Paid Search Plan</h2><div class="fa-ppc-process"><div><span>01</span><strong>Audit and strategy</strong><p>Define services, audience, economics, demand, risks, pages, and measurement.</p></div><div><span>02</span><strong>Build and review</strong><p>Create keywords, negatives, ads, pages, forms, disclosures, and tracking for firm approval.</p></div><div><span>03</span><strong>Controlled launch</strong><p>Launch narrowly, verify search terms and conversions, and protect budget.</p></div><div><span>04</span><strong>Quality feedback</strong><p>Connect CRM, call, meeting, and lost-reason data to campaign decisions.</p></div><div><span>05</span><strong>Monthly reporting</strong><p>Explain what changed, what it affected, and what happens next.</p></div></div><div class="intent-timeline"><div><strong>First 30 days</strong><p>Establish clean traffic, functioning tracking, approvals, and baseline lead quality.</p></div><div><strong>Days 31–60</strong><p>Refine queries, ads, pages, qualification, and appointment follow-up.</p></div><div><strong>Days 61–90</strong><p>Allocate budget using attended consultations, suitable opportunities, and lost reasons.</p></div></div></section>
